{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><figure><img src=\"https://cdn3.am730.com.hk/processed/2026-11/1063125/block/singleImage/3263808/df/01M73WTN6AFFQ73MRE1GDR0BDA.jpg?updatedAt=1794355887\"/><figcaption>粉嶺男工從貨車1米高墮下，頭部受傷清醒送院。(資料圖片)</figcaption></figure><p>粉嶺發生工業意外。今日(11日)凌晨1時許， 一名52歲姓楊男子在安樂門街22號於一輛貨車工作期間，意外從約1米高墮下，頭部受傷，其同事發現報案求助。救援人員到場，發現受傷及清醒的事主，隨即將他送往北區醫院治理。警方將案件列「工業意外—有人意外受傷」跟進。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-11T01:50:13.903609+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":157,"images":1,"source":"am730","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-11T00:48:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-12T02:00:40.775463+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-11T01:43:38.433985+00:00","content_hash":"acaf13529821fb9bc2aa9a6298881675027477eb0d98f124afbfacb59f90940a","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-11T01:50:13.903609+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}